       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QLCIC03.
      * CIC STATUS CORRECTION AFTER SETTLEMENT
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-REPORTED-DEFAULT       PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-DISPUTE-OPEN           PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-DAYS-SINCE-SETTLE      PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-CIC-ACTION             PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-REPORTED-DEFAULT
           ACCEPT WS-DISPUTE-OPEN
           ACCEPT WS-DAYS-SINCE-SETTLE
           PERFORM 2000-CIC
           DISPLAY 'CIC: ' WS-CIC-ACTION
           STOP RUN.
       2000-CIC.
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN WS-DISPUTE-OPEN = 'Y'
                 MOVE 'NODISCLOSE' TO WS-CIC-ACTION
              WHEN WS-REPORTED-DEFAULT = 'N'
                 MOVE 'NONE' TO WS-CIC-ACTION
              WHEN WS-DAYS-SINCE-SETTLE > 30
                 MOVE 'OVERDUE' TO WS-CIC-ACTION
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE 'UPDATE' TO WS-CIC-ACTION
           END-EVALUATE.
